On Apr 8, 10:15 am, "John H." <Joh...@gmail.com> wrote:

> I think Nethack scoring should be based primarily on:
> - Player wealth

I totally disagree. Wealth is a _tool_ in NetHack, it
would distort the game entirely to make it a _goal_.

Many, many commenters here recommend dumping gold as a
worthless nuisance past the midgame.

Your game would be much less fun to play than one with
scoring based on demonstrated skill rather than based
on demonstrated carrying capacity. Do we reward most
highly those who can nest bags of holding most deeply?
That's what "wealth as the main score component" would
end up entailing.

Why go there?

